 exclusiva\r\n\r\nCONDOMÍNIO:\r\n- Portaria 24h\r\n- Piscina externa\r\n- Piscina interna aquecida\r\n- Salão de festas\r\n- Espaço gourmet\r\n- Academia\r\n- Brinquedoteca\r\n\r\nAGENDE UMA VISITA, fale com Comercial (41) 3242 -6565\r\n* Os valores podem ser alterados sem qualquer aviso prévio.","fotos":["https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8b950ee8c.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8b9c23be6.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8b9f17e10.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8ba31a067.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8ba8cd8a3.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8bad82b7d.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8bbd63db1.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8bc206424.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8bc56329c.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8bc9c7456.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8bcd7a64f.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8bd20151c.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8bd5f1790.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8bda93d61.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8bde7808e.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8be348ccd.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8be7779cb.jpg","https://cdn.vistahost.com.br/agoncalv/vista.imobi/fotos/9644/iAClxrv_96446afc8beb7a2c7.jpg","https://cdn.vistah